    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[0]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Hi
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[0]._dialogues.Array.data[1]._content
      value: Hi, do i know you?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[0]._dialogues.Array.data[2]._content
      value: No you don't know me, yet ;) Saw you on that forum about the 'Lost Cause' book.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[0]._dialogues.Array.data[3]._content
      value: 'Here is the special edition cover:'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[0]._dialogues.Array.data[4]._content
      value: Ohhh that's cool!! Have you read it yourself? It's a great book.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[0]._dialogues.Array.data[5]._content
      value: WAIT. Don't tell me you actually liked that ending?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[0]._dialogues.Array.data[6]._content
      value: EXCUSE ME?? It was PERFECT
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[0]._dialogues.Array.data[7]._content
      value: The main character ignored EVERY warning sign
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[0]._dialogues.Array.data[8]._content
      value: THATS WHAT MADE ITS SOOO GOOD
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[0]._dialogues.Array.data[9]._content
      value: Okay you are actually funny
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
