      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[1]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: No you don't know me, yet ;) Saw you on that forum about the 'Lost Cause' book.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[1]._dialogues.Array.data[1]._content
      value: Ohhh that's cool!! Have you read it yourself? It's a great book.
