      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[2]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Oh, look who finally decided to show up.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[2]._dialogues.Array.data[1]._content
      value: Did you see what she posted yesterday? What a loser
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[2]._dialogues.Array.data[2]._content
      value: Imagine actually being that embarrassing
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[3]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Could you move please?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[3]._dialogues.Array.data[1]._content
      value: Last time i checked the booknerds dont talk, move yourself nerd.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[4]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: ...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[5]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Today was a looooong day
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[5]._dialogues.Array.data[1]._content
      value: You don't say
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[5]._dialogues.Array.data[2]._content
      value: What's up? Anything you want to talk about?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[7]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Oh that's okay, what's your favorite book?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[7]._dialogues.Array.data[1]._content
      value: Probably Lost Cause, but you knew that already hahah
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[7]._dialogues.Array.data[2]._content
      value: Should maybe have guessed that yeah haha
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[7]._dialogues.Array.data[3]._content
      value: What about you?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[7]._dialogues.Array.data[4]._content
      value: Mine is the same as yours!!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[7]._dialogues.Array.data[5]._content
      value: No wayyyy, never met someone with the same taste as me
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[7]._dialogues.Array.data[6]._content
      value: We should read the next book together when it comes out!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[7]._dialogues.Array.data[7]._content
      value: YES, id love that!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[7]._dialogues.Array.data[8]._content
      value: Its a date ;)
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[7]._dialogues.Array.data[9]._content
      value: HAHAHAH, shut up
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[8]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Wait what??? What do they do?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[8]._dialogues.Array.data[1]._content
      value: They just constantly make fun of me. I can't even walk into class without them saying something...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[8]._dialogues.Array.data[2]._content
      value: Have you told anyone about it?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[8]._dialogues.Array.data[3]._content
      value: Not really, it's not like anyone would care either way
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[8]._dialogues.Array.data[4]._content
      value: Hey, don't say that. I'm here for you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[8]._dialogues.Array.data[5]._content
      value: Thanks i guess, im just tired of it
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[8]._dialogues.Array.data[6]._content
      value: Atleast we have eachother!If you ever need someone to talk to you can always reach out to me
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[8]._dialogues.Array.data[7]._content
      value: Thanks, I appreciate it :) Im gonna go to bed now, seeya
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[9]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: GOOOOOD MORNING
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[9]._dialogues.Array.data[1]._content
      value: its wayyyy too early for this HAHAHAH
