      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[9]._dialogues.Array.data[4]._content
      value: Have fun at school nerd
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[0]._dialogues.Array.data[10]._content
      value: I have to go, im gonna be late for class
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[10]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Oh look, it's our favorite little bookworm.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[10]._dialogues.Array.data[1]._content
      value: Did you see her post yesterday? She's actually so embarrassing.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[10]._dialogues.Array.data[2]._content
      value: I wonder if she even has any friends.
